          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Mnamo siku ya kwanza ya sikukuu ya majuma wakati mnapomtolea Mwenyezi-Mungu malimbuko ya nafaka zenu, mtafanya mkutano mtakatifu; msifanye kazi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mtatoa sadaka ya kuteketezwa, harufu nzuri ya kumpendeza Mwenyezi-Mungu: Fahali wachanga wawili, kondoo dume mmoja, na wanakondoo saba madume wa mwaka mmoja, wote hao wawe hawana dosari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sadaka ya nafaka itakayoandamana nazo itakuwa ya unga safi uliochanganywa na mafuta kilo tatu kwa kila fahali, kilo mbili kwa kila kondoo dume, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 28:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na kilo moja kwa kila mwanakondoo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.28.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.28.29"
            ]
          }
